/P 75 0 R
/T (I am an Informatics Engineering graduate with a strong interest in backend development and system design, and I am eager to contribute to building scalable and reliable software solutions. My curiosity about how computers work started at an early age, which led me to explore both the software and hardware aspects of computer systems. As I grew older, I began learning various programming languages and web technologies, which strengthened my interest in software development. Through my academic projects and professional experiences, I have developed practical skills in backend development, database management, and API development, and I continue to expand my knowledge by building real-world projects and collaborating in team-based environments.)
