140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 78 0 R
/T (As part of my undergraduate thesis project, I developed the backend system for ANJELIKA, an application designed to support a maternity transportation service that helps pregnant women access healthcare facilities. In this project, I focused on backend development using Node.js, Express.js, and MySQL, where I designed the database structure and implemented 32 RESTful API endpoints to handle core system functionalities such as user management, booking requests, and driver assignments. I also applied concepts such as CRUD operations and relational database design to ensure structured data management within the system, which consisted of 5 main database tables. To ensure the reliability of the backend system, I conducted API testing using Postman to validate request handling and server responses across all endpoints. Through this project, I gained practical experience in backend architecture design, API development, and database management in a real-world system scenario. For a better understanding of the system implementation and API functionality, you can watch the demo video here: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZDpOcggRdZ55sYP7H5kTkqzctZkXGdpc/view?usp=drive_link)
/E (As part of my undergraduate thesis project, I developed the backend system for ANJELIKA, an application designed to support a maternity transportation service that helps pregnant women access healthcare facilities. In this project, I focused on backend development using Node.js, Express.js, and MySQL, where I designed the database structure and implemented 32 RESTful API endpoints to handle core system functionalities such as user management, booking requests, and driver assignments. I also applied concepts such as CRUD operations and relational database design to ensure structured data management within the system, which consisted of 5 main database tables. To ensure the reliability of the backend system, I conducted API testing using Postman to validate request handling and server responses across all endpoints. Through this project, I gained practical experience in backend architecture design, API development, and database management in a real-world system scenario. For a better understanding of the system implementation and API functionality, you can watch the demo video here: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZDpOcggRdZ55sYP7H5kTkqzctZkXGdpc/view?usp=drive_link)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3 184 0 R]
